mble Akiyama Yukari`s Tank Course: The Tanks of Small and Medium Countries) is TVDB S0E65 \"Akiyama Yukari's Tank Corner - Tanks from small and medium-sized countries\" and TMDB S0E65 \"不肖・秋山優花里の戦車講座～中小国の戦車たち～\" (Akiyama Yukari's Tank Corner - Tanks from Small and Medium Sized Countries); AniDB S8 \"1分ちょっとでわかる! ガールズ＆パンツァー最終章\" (Understanding Girls und Panzer das Finale in 1 Minute!) is TVDB S0E50 \"Understand in less than 1 minute! Girls und Panzer das Finale: Part 1\" and TMDB S0E56 \"1分ちょっとでわかる「ガールズ＆パンツァー 最終章」第1話\" (Understand in less than 1 minute! Girls \u0026 Panzer das Finale); AniDB S9-S29 (\"SEN-SHA WASH the PANZER\" (Wash the Panzer) to \"2021-03-27 Episode 03 Opening Memorial Theater Greeting Event\") have no TVDB episode (their defaults are other items) and no TMDB episode (their defaults are other items).",
